    const sourceQ2Progress = sourceQ2.result_id ? `<article class="completion-intro gate-progress"><div><p class="eyebrow">Common source q2 accepted</p><h3>${esc(sourceQ2.minimal_ordered_symbolic_components)} minimal operations plus ${Number(sourceQ2.auxiliary_ordered_component_coefficients).toLocaleString()} exact auxiliary coefficients</h3><p>The shifted-source operation has ${esc(sourceQ2.source_q2_families)} families and transports to ${esc(sourceQ2.graph_block_triples)} graph block triples. Its graph q1/q2, cyclicity and D/q2 defect counts are <b>${esc(sourceQ2.q1_q2_defects)} / ${esc(sourceQ2.q2_cyclicity_defects)} / ${esc(sourceQ2.D_q2_defects)}</b>.</p><p><a href="${esc(DATA.source_links.completion_source_q2_report)}">Read the common assembly report</a> · <a href="${esc(DATA.source_links.completion_source_q2)}">Inspect the accepted snapshot</a> · <a href="${esc(DATA.source_links.completion_diff_auxiliary_v2_report)}">Inspect the c-star V2 repair</a></p></div><aside><b>336 → 0</b><p>The historical V1 momentum-map convention left ${esc(sourceQ2.rejected_v1_q1_q2_defects)} exact coefficients. The canonical V2 translation leaves ${esc(sourceQ2.accepted_v2_q1_q2_defects)}. This arity-two layer is now the pinned predecessor of the common q3 snapshot.</p></aside></article>` : "";
    const sourceQ3Progress = sourceQ3.result_id ? `<article class="completion-intro gate-progress"><div><p class="eyebrow">Authoritative source q3 completed</p><h3>${Number(sourceQ3.auxiliary_ordered_q3_coefficients).toLocaleString()} paired auxiliary coefficients in ${esc(sourceQ3.source_q3_families)} exhaustive families</h3><p>The classical mass expansion has ${esc(sourceQ3.classical_independent_monomials)} independent monomials and ${esc(sourceQ3.classical_ordered_fourth_variations)} ordered fourth variations. The common graph arity-three, cyclicity and D/q3 defects are <b>${esc(sourceQ3.arity_three_defects)} / ${esc(sourceQ3.q3_cyclicity_defects_mod_d)} / ${esc(sourceQ3.D_q3_defects)}</b>.</p><p><a href="${esc(DATA.source_links.completion_source_q3_report)}">Read the common q3 report</a> · <a href="${esc(DATA.source_links.completion_source_q3)}">Inspect the snapshot</a> · <a href="${esc(DATA.source_links.completion_classical_quartic_report)}">Inspect the classical tensor</a></p></div><aside><b>605 Ward checks</b><p>The local Weyl channels close by exact conformal recursion. M1B/M1C now supply the cyclic and common-snapshot layers. The next tractable front is compatibility of this q3 together with q2 against both typed Lorentzian Green orientations.</p></aside></article>` : "";
